<h1 style="font-size:20px;margin:0 0 16px;">{{tenant_name}}</h1>
<p>Hello,</p>
<p><strong>{{inviter_email}}</strong> invites you to send files through the {{tenant_name}} transfer service.</p>
{{message}}
<p><a href="{{invitation_link}}" style="padding:12px 20px;background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;border-radius:4px;">Send my files</a></p>
<p>If the button does not work, copy this address into your browser:<br><span style="word-break:break-all;">{{invitation_link}}</span></p>
<p>You will first confirm your e-mail address with a code sent to you. This invitation expires on {{expiry_date}} if it is not used.</p>
<p>If you were not expecting this message, you can safely ignore it.</p>
<hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid #767676;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p style="font-size:14px;color:#4a4a4a;">This message was sent automatically by {{tenant_name}}. Please do not reply to it.</p>
